			<tr><th id="1">青森ねぶた祭</th></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_001.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/michinoku1_002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_002.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_003.jpg" --></a><a href="img/michinoku1_004.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_004.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_005.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_005_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_005.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_006.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_006.jpg" --></a><a href="img/michinoku1_007.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_007_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_007.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：田熊勝夫<br />
				<br />
				青森県各地で行われるねぶた祭りの山車（だし）。<br />
				<br />
				<a href="../../../kaiyodo_syokugann/bussanntenn/Michinoku#3">
				物産展シリーズでピカイチの出来栄え</a>だったフィギュアを復刻しました。<br />
				しかしそれは、過去のオーパーツと比較されてしまうという諸刃の剣。<br />
				容赦なく比較してみましょう。</td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_008.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_008_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_008.jpg" --></a><a href="img/michinoku1_009.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_009.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">
				左が本作（2016@400円）、右が物産展（2005年@ドリンクおまけ）。<br />
				大きな違いは背後の凧？のようなものが削除された点でしょう。<br />
				台座の塗装も省略されています。<br />
				</td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_010.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_010.jpg" --></a><a href="img/michinoku1_011.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_011_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_011.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_012.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_012.jpg" --></a><a href="img/michinoku1_013.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_013_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_013.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">
				閻魔大王の衣服の塗装も大幅に簡略化されています。<br />
				逆に言えば、食玩時代にはこんなに工数がかかるものをおまけで付けていたのが異常だったと言えます。<br />
				</td></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_014.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_014.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">孫悟空は特に下半身あたりの塗装の簡略化が目立ちます。<br />
				</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="2">南部鉄器</th></tr>
			<tr><td>
				<a href="img/michinoku1_015.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_015.jpg" --></a><a href="img/michinoku1_016.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/michinoku1_016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/cap_miyage/Michinoku1/img/michinoku1_016.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
